WEBVTT

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:36.860 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:39.940 line:0%
[Episode 21]

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:42.320 line:0%
Beat him!

00:01:43.279 --> 00:01:44.580 line:0%
[Princess Ying's Mansion]

00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:51.279 line:0%
Isn't that Mr. Han?

00:01:51.279 --> 00:01:52.040 line:0%
Stop.

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:55.660 line:0%
[Princess Ying's Mansion]

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:54.660 line:0%
Your Highness,

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:56.520 line:0%
this scoundrel has no shame.

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:57.800 line:0%
How dare he

00:01:57.800 --> 00:01:58.920 line:0%
come here again?

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:00.720 line:0%
We must teach him a lesson today.

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:04.760 line:0%
What are you doing here?

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:06.660 line:0%
Your Highness,

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:08.800 line:0%
please save Caiwei.

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:14.680 line:0%
Han Shiyuan,

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:16.520 line:0%
I gave you a chance,

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:18.520 line:0%
but you didn't cherish it.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:19.800 line:0%
Now,

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:23.030 line:0%
what do you have to beg me with?

00:02:24.430 --> 00:02:25.670 line:0%
[Princess Ying's Mansion]

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:26.660 line:0%
Your Highness.

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:28.540 line:0%
Your Highness,

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:31.100 line:0%
as long as you can save Caiwei,

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:32.270 line:0%
my life

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:33.480 line:0%
is all yours.

00:02:33.740 --> 00:02:34.810 line:0%
From now on,

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:36.590 line:0%
whatever you ask me to do,

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:38.280 line:0%
I will not refuse.

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:39.280 line:0%
[Princess Ying's Mansion]

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:39.720 line:0%
How dare you pester Her Highness!

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:40.520 line:0%
Enough!

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:45.060 line:0%
You really are a lovesick fool,

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:48.450 line:0%
willing to risk your own life for her.

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:49.730 line:0%
Unfortunately,

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:51.440 line:0%
I'm not the one

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:53.150 line:0%
who poisoned Yan Caiwei.

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:55.520 line:0%
I don't know how to save her either.

00:02:56.879 --> 00:02:58.840 line:0%
If you insist on dying with her,

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:01.520 line:0%
go die somewhere else.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:03.680 line:0%
Don't taint my sight here.

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:05.640 line:0%
Administer Yang,

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:08.650 line:0%
take him back to the Yan's Mansion.

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:10.320 line:0%
Don't let him die here.

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:13.560 line:0%
[Princess Ying's Mansion]

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:11.240 line:0%
Yes.

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:13.060 line:0%
Your Highness.

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:18.770 line:0%
[Princess Ying's Mansion]

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:19.290 line:0%
Your Highness! Your Highness!

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:22.400 line:0%
Your Highness,

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:24.280 line:0%
Yan Kuo is a coward,

00:03:24.360 --> 00:03:25.720 line:0%
unfit for any important task.

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:27.280 line:0%
But his daughters

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:29.040 line:0%
are all troublemakers.

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:31.330 line:0%
I'm not sure if Yan Caiwei's poisoning

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.280 line:0%
was done by Princess Ying

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:35.879 line:0%
or Chen Huo'e.

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:38.800 line:0%
If Yan Caiwei

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:39.920 line:0%
really dies from poisoning,

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:41.480 line:0%
I'm afraid Princess Ying and Chen Huo'e

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:42.920 line:0%
won't be able to clear their names.

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:43.640 line:0%
Actually,

00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:46.540 line:0%
it doesn't matter whether it was Princess Ying or not.

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:48.280 line:0%
Shen Du will surely stand on our side

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:49.720 line:0%
for the sake of his sister-in-law.

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:51.440 line:0%
Even if Shen Du remains foolish

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:52.900 line:0%
and doesn't align with us,

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.120 line:0%
Princess Ying

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:56.080 line:0%
won't dare trust him anymore.

00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:58.120 line:0%
Mentor,

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:00.490 line:0%
all these years,

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:03.200 line:0%
how many things

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:04.800 line:0%
have you done behind my back?

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:08.460 line:0%
Your Highness,

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:10.890 line:0%
I know you are kind-hearted,

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:12.760 line:0%
but to achieve great things, one mustn't mind minor details.

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:15.000 line:0%
Ruthlessness is the mark of a truly great man.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.750 line:0%
You were born into the royal family;

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:17.920 line:0%
you certainly can't escape

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:19.440 line:0%
the power struggles.

00:04:19.629 --> 00:04:21.560 line:0%
Even the current Grand Empress Dowager

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:22.920 line:0%
had to be cautious with every step

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:24.780 line:0%
of the way to secure her position.

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:27.520 line:0%
The death of the Crown Prince back then was suspicious,

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:29.980 line:0%
-and now the young emperor...
-How dare you!

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:32.760 line:0%
I have spoken out of turn.

00:04:33.959 --> 00:04:34.800 line:0%
But my

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:37.550 line:0%
loyalty to Your Highness

00:04:37.959 --> 00:04:39.290 line:0%
is as clear as the sun.

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:50.360 line:0%
Mentor,

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:52.120 line:0%
over these years,

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:54.610 line:0%
your sincere efforts to protect me

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:56.360 line:0%
and all these things you've done

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:58.270 line:0%
to pave the way for me,

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:00.560 line:0%
I am well aware of them.

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:05.800 line:0%
But I really don't want

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:07.080 line:0%
to see infighting

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:08.280 line:0%
and family disputes.

00:05:09.560 --> 00:05:10.890 line:0%
If it has to come to that,

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:13.690 line:0%
I'd rather not be the Regent.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:15.160 line:0%
Your Highness!

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:18.960 line:0%
You mustn't think

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:20.720 line:0%
like that!

00:05:21.950 --> 00:05:23.810 line:0%
You are the esteemed Prince Xian,

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:24.840 line:0%
and you are

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:27.040 line:0%
destined to be the Regent

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:28.800 line:0%
of our great Cang State.

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:31.480 line:0%
Everything I've done

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:34.550 line:0%
is for you.

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:36.890 line:0%
Your Highness.

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:42.560 line:0%
How foolish.

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:46.570 line:0%
How foolish.

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:52.080 line:0%
Mentor,

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:54.800 line:0%
is power really

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:57.800 line:0%
worth being obsessed with?

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:23.350 line:0%
[Grand Commander's Office]

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:26.560 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:30.250 line:0%
[Grand Commander's Office]

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:33.000 line:0%
Are you worried about

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:34.080 line:0%
Madam's matter?

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:35.440 line:0%
Nonsense.

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:37.080 line:0%
Yes.

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:38.140 line:0%
I spoke out of turn.

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:39.200 line:0%
But

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:40.920 line:0%
I seem to know

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:42.720 line:0%
why Madam

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:44.520 line:0%
was at the Ministry of Justice

00:06:44.890 --> 00:06:46.690 line:0%
working all night yesterday.

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:51.560 line:0%
Yan Mojie came to me yesterday.

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:52.640 line:0%
He asked me

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:53.440 line:0%
to look through

00:06:53.440 --> 00:06:54.480 line:0%
the archives.

00:06:54.520 --> 00:06:55.280 line:0%
I heard that

00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:57.480 line:0%
the third lady of the Yan family was poisoned

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:58.280 line:0%
by

00:06:59.070 --> 00:07:00.700 line:0%
the Fire Moth Sect's

00:07:01.140 --> 00:07:01.780 line:0%
Meta-

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:02.570 line:0%
mor-

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:03.230 line:0%
pho-

00:07:03.260 --> 00:07:03.910 line:0%
sis.

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:08.470 line:0%
Metamorphosis?

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:10.770 line:0%
[Grand Commander's Office]

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:09.050 line:0%
Yes.

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:10.260 line:0%
The entire Yan's Mansion

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:12.200 line:0%
has been in chaos these past two days

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.360 line:0%
because of this.

00:07:13.380 --> 00:07:15.440 line:0%
The entire Yan's Mansion is in chaos?

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:18.360 line:0%
How come I haven't heard a word about it?

00:07:19.280 --> 00:07:22.240 line:0%
Perhaps Madam didn't want to trouble you.

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:23.600 line:0%
Even Yan Mojie knows

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:25.930 line:0%
to seek your help when there's trouble.

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:27.720 line:0%
How could she not know who to turn to?

00:07:27.720 --> 00:07:28.640 line:0%
Then Madam must have

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:29.760 line:0%
her own ways.

00:07:31.410 --> 00:07:32.600 line:0%
I heard that

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:33.400 line:0%
Madam went to the palace today

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:35.040 line:0%
to consult with the imperial physicians.

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:35.840 line:0%
And

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:37.360 line:0%
she showed them a

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:40.240 line:0%
antidote formula from the Imperial Investigation Department.

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:41.040 line:0%
I heard

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:41.840 line:0%
it was Chen Huo'e's

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:43.840 line:0%
confession during interrogation.

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:46.290 line:0%
Imperial Investigation Department.

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:48.390 line:0%
Chen Huo'e.

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:50.120 line:0%
I've already inquired

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:51.120 line:0%
with that physician.

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:51.920 line:0%
He said

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:54.480 line:0%
the antidote is most likely genuine.

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:56.010 line:0%
However,

00:07:56.480 --> 00:07:58.080 line:0%
there's a deadly ingredient

00:07:58.280 --> 00:07:59.520 line:0%
in it.

00:07:59.820 --> 00:08:00.800 line:0%
What is it?

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:03.140 line:0%
It's the mirror-image

00:08:03.270 --> 00:08:04.220 line:0%
person's

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:05.170 line:0%
heart

00:08:05.490 --> 00:08:06.520 line:0%
blood.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:15.320 line:0%
[Lai's Mansion]

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:26.440 line:0%
[Lai's Mansion]

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:35.000 line:0%
Anyone there?

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:36.560 line:0%
Is there

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:38.359 line:0%
not a single living person here?

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:44.280 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:45.160 line:0%
what kind of trick is

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:46.360 line:0%
Lai Luozhi planning?

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:48.150 line:0%
Since you know it's a trick,

00:08:48.240 --> 00:08:49.240 line:0%
why be so anxious?

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:50.970 line:0%
Stay here.

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:52.540 line:0%
I'll go check the back.

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:53.680 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:54.400 line:0%
It's fine.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:49.800 line:0%
Lord Lai!

00:09:50.410 --> 00:09:52.320 line:0%
You've set up such an elaborate scheme.

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:54.200 line:0%
Isn't it just to lure me here?

00:09:54.560 --> 00:09:55.440 line:0%
Why?

00:09:55.890 --> 00:09:56.900 line:0%
Here I am,

00:09:57.400 --> 00:09:59.480 line:0%
but you're hiding and afraid to show yourself.

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:00.280 line:0%
This doesn't match

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:01.940 line:0%
your usual domineering style

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:03.580 line:0%
in court.

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:22.270 line:0%
I apologize for disturbing you.

00:10:22.270 --> 00:10:23.590 line:0%
I've been too abrupt.

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:51.280 line:0%
Grand Commander, you first came to my residence,

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:53.400 line:0%
chasing after a lady in the backyard.

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:55.160 line:0%
If this gets out,

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:56.880 line:0%
it'll be another joke.

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:57.680 line:0%
Lord Lai,

00:10:58.720 --> 00:10:59.440 line:0%
put away all these

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:01.170 line:0%
intimidating tricks of yours.

00:11:11.800 --> 00:11:14.520 line:0%
These superficial parlor tricks

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:16.940 line:0%
naturally don't impress the White Ghost.

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:19.320 line:0%
However, Grand Commander Shen,

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:22.650 line:0%
you've trespassed into my residence without reason today.

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:25.300 line:0%
You owe me an explanation, don't you?

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:28.540 line:0%
If I hadn't come,

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:31.200 line:0%
would you have given me the heart blood

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:32.800 line:0%
of the mirror-image person?

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:35.160 line:0%
Where did you get this idea?

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:38.130 line:0%
You deliberately poisoned Yan Caiwei

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:40.290 line:0%
and let Yan Xing get the prescription.

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:41.200 line:0%
Naturally, you must have

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:43.040 line:0%
Chen Huo'e's heart blood

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:46.600 line:0%
to use as bait for exchange.

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:48.480 line:0%
What you're saying

00:11:48.480 --> 00:11:49.940 line:0%
is just your speculation.

00:11:50.450 --> 00:11:52.490 line:0%
I don't admit to any of it.

00:11:56.840 --> 00:11:57.730 line:0%
However,

00:11:58.700 --> 00:12:01.560 line:0%
regarding the mirror-image person's heart blood,

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:03.720 line:0%
as it happens,

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:06.490 line:0%
I do have one.

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:31.320 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:12:31.320 --> 00:12:32.120 line:0%
please don't.

00:12:37.720 --> 00:12:38.520 line:0%
What?

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:40.880 line:0%
Are you worried the water here is dirty

00:12:40.880 --> 00:12:42.440 line:0%
or it might be poisoned?

00:12:53.950 --> 00:12:55.440 line:0%
I have always been

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:56.640 line:0%
admired you.

00:12:57.320 --> 00:12:59.180 line:0%
You've made quite a show

00:12:59.280 --> 00:13:01.920 line:0%
of barging into my residence with the Imperial Guards.

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:03.610 line:0%
If you can't leave today,

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:05.440 line:0%
or if you leave and then

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:06.900 line:0%
soon fall ill from poison,

00:13:07.320 --> 00:13:08.780 line:0%
I really wouldn't know how

00:13:08.960 --> 00:13:10.760 line:0%
to explain it to Her Majesty.

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:13.730 line:0%
Where is the mirror-image person's heart blood?

00:13:15.930 --> 00:13:17.660 line:0%
It's right here in this teacup.

00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:25.520 line:0%
You tricked the Grand Commander into drinking it?

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:37.620 line:0%
You sealed the mirror-image person's heart blood

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:39.380 line:0%
in this teacup.

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:46.040 line:0%
I specifically sought out

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:48.350 line:0%
skilled craftsmen from Xichen

00:13:48.440 --> 00:13:49.840 line:0%
to make this

00:13:49.860 --> 00:13:51.640 line:0%
heart blood teacup.

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:58.490 line:0%
Actually,

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:00.440 line:0%
what you've been looking for

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:02.340 line:0%
has been right in front of you all along.

00:14:02.340 --> 00:14:03.560 line:0%
Yet you've been avoiding my residence

00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:04.720 line:0%
like the plague,

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:06.760 line:0%
not even daring to drink a cup of tea.

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:12.250 line:0%
Actually,

00:14:13.230 --> 00:14:14.280 line:0%
I am not

00:14:14.280 --> 00:14:16.000 line:0%
that untrustworthy,

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:19.000 line:0%
am I?

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:24.520 line:0%
Nowadays,

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:26.080 line:0%
the mirror-image person's heart blood

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:27.160 line:0%
is extremely rare.

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:30.200 line:0%
This cup is even more ingeniously crafted.

00:14:30.600 --> 00:14:32.400 line:0%
Naturally, it won't be given for free.

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:33.200 line:0%
You've set up

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:35.460 line:0%
such an elaborate scheme to lure me here.

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:36.840 line:0%
What do you want?

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:38.280 line:0%
Just say it.

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:44.640 line:0%
It's always easier

00:14:44.760 --> 00:14:46.320 line:0%
talking to smart people.

00:14:46.920 --> 00:14:47.860 line:0%
Actually,

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:49.840 line:0%
I don't have many demands.

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:51.200 line:0%
I just need you

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:52.760 line:0%
to remember this favor.

00:14:53.190 --> 00:14:54.780 line:0%
You'll have to return it

00:14:55.110 --> 00:14:56.930 line:0%
in full someday.

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:11.850 line:0%
Then there's no other way.

00:15:12.600 --> 00:15:14.440 line:0%
It all depends on whether you truly

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:16.470 line:0%
love your wife so much

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:18.260 line:0%
that you're willing to

00:15:18.320 --> 00:15:19.040 line:0%
gamble on an unknown

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:21.010 line:0%
promise to save her sister.

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:33.810 line:0%
Fine,

00:15:39.420 --> 00:15:40.380 line:0%
I see.

00:15:47.470 --> 00:15:48.570 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:49.690 line:0%
farewell.

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:14.790 line:0%
I really don't understand

00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:17.210 line:0%
why you went through all this trouble.

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:18.080 line:0%
First poisoned someone

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:19.290 line:0%
then provided the antidote,

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:21.550 line:0%
and let me show my face in front of Shen Du.

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:23.650 line:0%
What exactly are you plotting?

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:25.750 line:0%
[Guangyue Restaurant]

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:36.710 line:0%
You don't need to understand.

00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:45.410 line:0%
I don't need to understand?

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:48.210 line:0%
Haven't we all

00:16:48.380 --> 00:16:50.510 line:0%
sacrificed enough for your so-called

00:16:50.630 --> 00:16:52.390 line:0%
grand ambitions?

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:53.600 line:0%
Now...

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:58.120 line:0%
I don't even have the right

00:16:58.120 --> 00:16:59.280 line:0%
to ask a question?

00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:08.930 line:0%
I was wrong,

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:10.800 line:0%
Sister.

00:17:12.190 --> 00:17:13.629 line:0%
I was just upset.

00:17:13.930 --> 00:17:15.930 line:0%
How could I not know your hardships?

00:17:16.520 --> 00:17:18.139 line:0%
Everything I've done

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:19.280 line:0%
is to ensure

00:17:19.280 --> 00:17:20.600 line:0%
that all of our efforts

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:22.510 line:0%
receive their due rewards.

00:17:22.869 --> 00:17:24.360 line:0%
Poisoning Yan Caiwei

00:17:24.629 --> 00:17:26.369 line:0%
can provoke suspicion among Prince Xian,

00:17:26.369 --> 00:17:27.230 line:0%
Princess Ying,

00:17:27.590 --> 00:17:29.780 line:0%
and the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:32.280 line:0%
This goal has already been achieved.

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:34.030 line:0%
As for Shen Du,

00:17:34.690 --> 00:17:37.150 line:0%
he is indeed the most difficult to deal with.

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:39.760 line:0%
Both the Imperial Security Bureau and the Shen's Mansion

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:41.420 line:0%
are tightly secured,

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:42.980 line:0%
and all our spies

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:44.760 line:0%
have been eliminated.

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:47.290 line:0%
Shen Du works for Prince Xian?

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:50.360 line:0%
No.

00:17:51.490 --> 00:17:52.840 line:0%
Shen Du has always maintained neutrality

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:53.920 line:0%
in the court.

00:17:54.660 --> 00:17:56.520 line:0%
He neither sides with Prince Xian

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:58.070 line:0%
nor Princess Ying,

00:17:58.500 --> 00:18:00.820 line:0%
and keeps his distance from me.

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:04.880 line:0%
The more cautiously he

00:18:04.880 --> 00:18:06.280 line:0%
maintains this balance,

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:08.460 line:0%
the more Her Majesty

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:10.170 line:0%
trusts him,

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:12.360 line:0%
which makes what we're doing

00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:14.020 line:0%
even more difficult.

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:16.040 line:0%
Then why not simply kill him

00:18:16.140 --> 00:18:18.260 line:0%
or directly make demands of him?

00:18:19.050 --> 00:18:21.570 line:0%
Unknown promises are the most terrifying.

00:18:23.140 --> 00:18:24.630 line:0%
I want to make him feel

00:18:24.680 --> 00:18:25.840 line:0%
uneasy in his heart,

00:18:26.130 --> 00:18:27.630 line:0%
fearful,

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:29.650 line:0%
and hesitant about every move.

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:33.560 line:0%
When fear takes root

00:18:33.560 --> 00:18:35.140 line:0%
and grows in his heart,

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:36.660 line:0%
one day

00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:40.320 line:0%
I'll make him more useful than

00:18:42.210 --> 00:18:43.850 line:0%
if he were dead.

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:02.220 line:0%
-Xing.
-Xing.

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:03.790 line:0%
Xing,

00:19:03.900 --> 00:19:06.010 line:0%
all the ingredients are ready,

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:06.880 line:0%
except for

00:19:06.880 --> 00:19:09.140 line:0%
the mirror-image person's heart blood.

00:19:09.240 --> 00:19:10.640 line:0%
But your father hit a snag

00:19:10.680 --> 00:19:12.160 line:0%
with Minister Zhang,

00:19:12.280 --> 00:19:13.400 line:0%
and Shiyuan got beaten

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:14.680 line:0%
by Princess Yong'an.

00:19:18.100 --> 00:19:20.380 line:0%
I really don't know what else to do.

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:23.320 line:0%
I'm begging you.

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:24.880 line:0%
Please think of another way.

00:19:24.880 --> 00:19:25.840 line:0%
-Madam.
-Madam.

00:19:25.840 --> 00:19:27.300 line:0%
Madam, what are you doing?

00:19:27.320 --> 00:19:29.390 line:0%
Aren't you pushing Xing too hard?

00:19:30.950 --> 00:19:32.960 line:0%
She's already trying everything she can

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:34.200 line:0%
and exhausted herself like this.

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:36.060 line:0%
What else can she possibly do?

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:39.720 line:0%
There's still...

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:47.240 line:0%
There's still the Grand Commander.

00:19:48.210 --> 00:19:49.880 line:0%
Shut your mouth!

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:51.800 line:0%
Why should I shut up?

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:52.840 line:0%
That Chen Huo'e

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:54.520 line:0%
was killed by White Ghost.

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:57.140 line:0%
Now the retribution has fallen on my daughter.

00:19:57.240 --> 00:19:58.040 line:0%
Why can't I

00:19:58.040 --> 00:20:00.320 line:0%
ask White Ghost

00:20:00.320 --> 00:20:02.040 line:0%
to find a way?

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:04.880 line:0%
Even if Caiwei once wronged him,

00:20:05.040 --> 00:20:06.080 line:0%
she's still

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:08.510 line:0%
his sister-in-law now.

00:20:11.360 --> 00:20:12.540 line:0%
-Madam...
-You're right.

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:13.940 line:0%
I came too late.

00:20:25.360 --> 00:20:26.960 line:0%
-Grand Commander.
-No need.

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:28.980 line:0%
Here's the key ingredient for the antidote.

00:20:28.980 --> 00:20:30.240 line:0%
The mirror-image person's heart blood

00:20:30.240 --> 00:20:31.800 line:0%
is in this teacup.

00:20:33.980 --> 00:20:36.610 line:0%
Thank you, Grand Commander, for saving Caiwei's life.

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:37.470 line:0%
Get up quickly.

00:20:40.060 --> 00:20:42.120 line:0%
Xing and I are one as husband and wife.

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:43.890 line:0%
Whatever happens to the Yan family

00:20:43.890 --> 00:20:45.260 line:0%
is my concern too.

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:51.180 line:0%
The antidote is urgent.

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:53.880 line:0%
Thank you, Grand Commander.

00:20:53.880 --> 00:20:54.720 line:0%
I'll take this to prepare the medicine right away.

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:55.700 line:0%
Thank you, Grand Commander.

00:20:55.700 --> 00:20:56.760 line:0%
Hurry up.

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:57.350 line:0%
Hurry.

00:20:57.560 --> 00:20:58.880 line:0%
Caiwei can be saved now.

00:20:58.880 --> 00:21:00.280 line:0%
Caiwei can be saved now.

00:21:00.300 --> 00:21:01.490 line:0%
Come on.

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:10.520 line:0%
Xing.

00:21:12.570 --> 00:21:13.680 line:0%
When will I be

00:21:13.680 --> 00:21:14.640 line:0%
the first one you turn to

00:21:14.640 --> 00:21:15.730 line:0%
when you need help?

00:21:17.160 --> 00:21:20.540 line:0%
♫I'll wait until the years blossom like flowers♫

00:21:21.440 --> 00:21:25.270 line:0%
♫The ice and snow slowly melted♫

00:21:27.360 --> 00:21:30.770 line:0%
♫I heard those tender words♫

00:21:30.170 --> 00:21:30.970 line:0%
Xing.

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:35.740 line:0%
♫He told her, "I love you"♫

00:21:56.790 --> 00:21:59.850 line:0%
♫What I saw in my dreams♫

00:22:00.820 --> 00:22:04.660 line:0%
♫Is not a flashy illusion♫

00:22:05.860 --> 00:22:10.520 line:0%
♫I don't fear the challenges ahead, riding a white horse to chase after time♫

00:22:06.160 --> 00:22:06.960 line:0%
Alright.

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:13.420 line:0%
♫Let's go together♫

00:22:15.720 --> 00:22:20.400 line:0%
♫Love is pure and flawless, indifferent to the changes of the world♫

00:22:20.920 --> 00:22:24.190 line:0%
♫Let's experience it together♫

00:22:24.930 --> 00:22:26.540 line:0%
Can we really trust

00:22:26.560 --> 00:22:28.000 line:0%
what Lai Luozhi said?

00:22:28.150 --> 00:22:29.860 line:0%
Is the heart blood

00:22:29.940 --> 00:22:31.190 line:0%
he gave reliable?

00:22:32.560 --> 00:22:33.520 line:0%
No one's words

00:22:34.130 --> 00:22:35.670 line:0%
can be fully trusted.

00:22:40.640 --> 00:22:41.440 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:22:42.520 --> 00:22:44.120 line:0%
I have something to tell you.

00:22:45.200 --> 00:22:46.330 line:0%
If I don't say it now,

00:22:47.340 --> 00:22:49.600 line:0%
I'm afraid I won't have the chance later.

00:22:52.400 --> 00:22:53.360 line:0%
Do you know

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:55.480 line:0%
why Minister Zhang insisted on

00:22:55.480 --> 00:22:56.520 line:0%
marrying a daughter

00:22:56.520 --> 00:22:57.980 line:0%
from the Yan family to you?

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:03.960 line:0%
Minister Zhang used my father and our entire family as leverage

00:23:03.960 --> 00:23:05.420 line:0%
to arrange this marriage.

00:23:05.920 --> 00:23:07.560 line:0%
It was supposed to be Caiwei marrying you,

00:23:07.560 --> 00:23:09.200 line:0%
but I took her place and married you.

00:23:09.200 --> 00:23:11.600 line:0%
Minister Zhang still wanted me to find a way

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:12.560 line:0%
to be his and Prince Xian's

00:23:12.560 --> 00:23:14.020 line:0%
spy in the Shen's Mansion.

00:23:15.640 --> 00:23:17.320 line:0%
But I never truly did anything to harm you

00:23:17.320 --> 00:23:18.850 line:0%
for Prince Xian's faction.

00:23:25.680 --> 00:23:26.480 line:0%
I know.

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:29.860 line:0%
I believe you would never harm me.

00:23:31.200 --> 00:23:32.120 line:0%
You know?

00:23:35.450 --> 00:23:36.810 line:0%
You really believe me?

00:23:40.120 --> 00:23:40.920 line:0%
Xing,

00:23:44.200 --> 00:23:45.280 line:0%
since you have never done

00:23:45.280 --> 00:23:46.560 line:0%
anything against me,

00:23:46.760 --> 00:23:48.490 line:0%
there's no need to feel guilty.

00:23:51.000 --> 00:23:51.760 line:0%
If you have any

00:23:51.760 --> 00:23:53.160 line:0%
doubts in the future,

00:23:54.100 --> 00:23:55.340 line:0%
just come and ask me.

00:23:56.120 --> 00:23:56.920 line:0%
Alright?

00:24:10.830 --> 00:24:12.560 line:0%
What are you doing?

00:24:12.760 --> 00:24:13.820 line:0%
Spit it out quickly!

00:24:13.820 --> 00:24:14.990 line:0%
Spit it out now!

00:24:15.200 --> 00:24:16.040 line:0%
Spit!

00:24:16.480 --> 00:24:17.440 line:0%
Spit it out!

00:24:17.440 --> 00:24:17.960 line:0%
Hurry!

00:24:17.960 --> 00:24:20.760 line:0%
If you can test the medicine for your third sister,

00:24:21.000 --> 00:24:22.360 line:0%
I can do it for you too.

00:24:23.170 --> 00:24:25.080 line:0%
Who asked you to do it for me?

00:24:26.950 --> 00:24:27.720 line:0%
You--

00:24:28.200 --> 00:24:28.920 line:0%
I will use my inner energy

00:24:28.920 --> 00:24:30.720 line:0%
to spread the medicine throughout my body.

00:24:30.720 --> 00:24:31.480 line:0%
If I'm still fine

00:24:31.480 --> 00:24:32.640 line:0%
after a moment,

00:24:32.800 --> 00:24:34.680 line:0%
your third sister can take the medicine without worry.

00:24:34.680 --> 00:24:36.080 line:0%
Why are you so foolish?

00:24:36.080 --> 00:24:36.960 line:0%
Me testing the medicine for my third sister

00:24:36.960 --> 00:24:37.840 line:0%
is what family should do.

00:24:37.840 --> 00:24:39.100 line:0%
What are you thinking?

00:24:39.480 --> 00:24:40.920 line:0%
Are you feeling unwell anywhere?

00:24:40.920 --> 00:24:42.000 line:0%
Your injury has just healed.

00:24:42.000 --> 00:24:43.040 line:0%
How could you take such a risk?

00:24:43.040 --> 00:24:43.720 line:0%
Do you feel

00:24:43.720 --> 00:24:44.860 line:0%
any discomfort after drinking it?

00:24:44.860 --> 00:24:45.960 line:0%
Is there any pain?

00:24:45.960 --> 00:24:47.760 line:0%
Tell me, are you feeling unwell?

00:24:58.200 --> 00:24:59.760 line:0%
Say something!

00:24:59.760 --> 00:25:00.920 line:0%
I'm really fine.

00:25:04.800 --> 00:25:05.560 line:0%
Since Lai Luozhi

00:25:05.560 --> 00:25:07.210 line:0%
intentionally lured me there,

00:25:07.210 --> 00:25:09.410 line:0%
the medicine he gave should be genuine.

00:25:09.540 --> 00:25:10.640 line:0%
He just didn't expect

00:25:10.640 --> 00:25:11.720 line:0%
that I would test the medicine myself.

00:25:11.720 --> 00:25:12.840 line:0%
Otherwise,

00:25:13.120 --> 00:25:13.800 line:0%
he might have really put

00:25:13.800 --> 00:25:15.370 line:0%
something lethal in it.

00:25:23.710 --> 00:25:24.610 line:0%
Ouch.

00:25:26.610 --> 00:25:27.610 line:0%
Ouch.

00:25:29.030 --> 00:25:30.040 line:0%
Let me see.

00:25:49.000 --> 00:25:50.400 line:0%
I didn't die from poison,

00:25:52.660 --> 00:25:54.570 line:0%
but I might die from your beating.

00:26:06.680 --> 00:26:07.880 line:0%
The medicine is fine.

00:26:08.680 --> 00:26:10.520 line:0%
Hurry and take it to your third sister.

00:26:10.520 --> 00:26:11.240 line:0%
Go now.

00:26:22.670 --> 00:26:25.180 line:0%
[Reviving Elegant Music]

00:26:23.150 --> 00:26:25.040 line:0%
Coming! The medicine is here.

00:26:25.660 --> 00:26:26.580 line:0%
Hurry up.

00:26:52.400 --> 00:26:53.200 line:0%
Don't worry.

00:26:54.160 --> 00:26:55.290 line:0%
She'll wake up soon.

00:26:59.320 --> 00:27:01.200 line:0%
It's been two hours already.

00:27:05.280 --> 00:27:06.380 line:0%
Mother.

00:27:06.740 --> 00:27:07.680 line:0%
Caiwei.

00:27:07.760 --> 00:27:08.640 line:0%
You're awake.

00:27:16.920 --> 00:27:17.680 line:0%
Mother.

00:27:17.680 --> 00:27:18.480 line:0%
Sister Caiwei.

00:27:18.480 --> 00:27:20.140 line:0%
Sister Caiwei, you're awake.

00:27:20.440 --> 00:27:21.430 line:0%
Xing.

00:27:25.960 --> 00:27:26.900 line:0%
Father.

00:27:30.010 --> 00:27:31.140 line:0%
Where is Shiyuan?

00:27:31.170 --> 00:27:32.000 line:0%
Caiwei.

00:27:34.860 --> 00:27:35.720 line:0%
Shiyuan.

00:27:36.480 --> 00:27:37.870 line:0%
What happened to you?

00:27:40.800 --> 00:27:41.600 line:0%
Father.

00:27:41.670 --> 00:27:45.030 line:0%
[Reviving Elegant Music]

00:27:42.000 --> 00:27:42.800 line:0%
Father,

00:27:42.890 --> 00:27:44.560 line:0%
Princess Ying sent a gift box,

00:27:44.560 --> 00:27:45.600 line:0%
along with a note.

00:27:45.640 --> 00:27:46.840 line:0%
Princess Ying?

00:27:46.930 --> 00:27:47.850 line:0%
Read it.

00:27:48.640 --> 00:27:50.760 line:0%
I've heard that Mr. Han and Yan Caiwei

00:27:50.780 --> 00:27:51.860 line:0%
have a deep bond,

00:27:51.960 --> 00:27:53.180 line:0%
unwavering even in life and death.

00:27:53.180 --> 00:27:54.510 line:0%
This intense affection

00:27:54.520 --> 00:27:55.720 line:0%
is like the lush blossoms of

00:27:55.720 --> 00:27:57.120 line:0%
the flowering Chinese bush cherry.

00:27:57.120 --> 00:27:59.500 line:0%
It fills me with admiration and envy.

00:27:59.600 --> 00:28:01.570 line:0%
I wish to help fulfill their beautiful intentions.

00:28:01.570 --> 00:28:02.950 line:0%
Such deep love

00:28:03.130 --> 00:28:04.450 line:0%
cannot be denied by heaven.

00:28:04.450 --> 00:28:06.350 line:0%
I specially grant this beautiful jade ruyi,

00:28:06.350 --> 00:28:09.010 line:0%
wishing you to remain close in harmony forever.

00:28:20.040 --> 00:28:20.840 line:0%
It seems

00:28:21.280 --> 00:28:22.280 line:0%
Princess Ying

00:28:22.280 --> 00:28:22.800 line:0%
has decided to

00:28:22.800 --> 00:28:24.240 line:0%
stop pursuing Mr. Han

00:28:24.240 --> 00:28:25.840 line:0%
and to bless you two instead.

00:28:52.200 --> 00:28:53.000 line:0%
Xing.

00:28:55.060 --> 00:28:56.390 line:0%
Are you feeling unwell?

00:28:57.760 --> 00:28:58.680 line:0%
No, no.

00:29:03.180 --> 00:29:05.120 line:0%
Why would Lai Luozhi do this?

00:29:05.530 --> 00:29:07.050 line:0%
Poisoning and then providing the cure—

00:29:07.050 --> 00:29:08.410 line:0%
what's the point of

00:29:08.430 --> 00:29:09.510 line:0%
all this trouble?

00:29:13.560 --> 00:29:14.240 line:0%
His target

00:29:14.240 --> 00:29:15.970 line:0%
might not be your third sister,

00:29:18.360 --> 00:29:19.200 line:0%
but me.

00:29:20.480 --> 00:29:21.820 line:0%
He set a trap,

00:29:22.120 --> 00:29:23.080 line:0%
gained leverage over you,

00:29:23.080 --> 00:29:24.160 line:0%
and did you a favor.

00:29:25.690 --> 00:29:27.200 line:0%
Did he threaten you into

00:29:27.200 --> 00:29:28.600 line:0%
promising him anything?

00:29:34.880 --> 00:29:35.680 line:0%
Don't worry.

00:29:36.780 --> 00:29:37.580 line:0%
It's fine.

00:29:38.860 --> 00:29:40.120 line:0%
It's your third sister

00:29:41.820 --> 00:29:44.420 line:0%
who has suffered this undeserved misfortune.

00:29:47.940 --> 00:29:48.950 line:0%
So,

00:29:50.210 --> 00:29:52.020 line:0%
pursuing justice

00:29:52.170 --> 00:29:53.590 line:0%
and seeking the truth

00:29:54.710 --> 00:29:56.480 line:0%
really can bring unknown risks

00:29:56.480 --> 00:29:58.000 line:0%
to our loved ones.

00:30:04.200 --> 00:30:05.000 line:0%
But

00:30:06.000 --> 00:30:07.250 line:0%
the path we've chosen

00:30:07.350 --> 00:30:08.280 line:0%
is destined to be

00:30:08.280 --> 00:30:09.680 line:0%
a thorny one, isn't it?

00:30:10.460 --> 00:30:12.040 line:0%
Since we've made our choice,

00:30:12.040 --> 00:30:13.840 line:0%
I will absolutely not regret it.

00:30:14.650 --> 00:30:16.200 line:0%
We must follow our hearts

00:30:16.240 --> 00:30:17.520 line:0%
and also do our utmost

00:30:17.520 --> 00:30:19.050 line:0%
to protect those around us.

00:30:37.640 --> 00:30:40.910 line:0%
♫With a gaze, I know our destiny♫

00:30:41.370 --> 00:30:44.670 line:0%
♫When we meet again, I know you're my Mr. Right♫

00:30:45.460 --> 00:30:48.710 line:0%
♫The stars remind me of our past♫

00:30:49.580 --> 00:30:51.890 line:0%
♫Our love started to grow long ago♫

00:30:50.290 --> 00:30:51.160 line:0%
Xing.

00:30:52.290 --> 00:30:55.820 line:0%
♫Don't ask about the thoughts of the lover by the candlelight♫

00:30:55.440 --> 00:30:56.200 line:0%
You can focus on doing

00:30:56.200 --> 00:30:57.480 line:0%
what you believe is right.

00:30:56.240 --> 00:30:59.560 line:0%
♫Our love will last forever♫

00:31:00.000 --> 00:31:03.350 line:0%
♫With the gentle night breeze, I tell you how much I love you♫

00:31:00.870 --> 00:31:02.010 line:0%
I'll protect you

00:31:03.020 --> 00:31:04.510 line:0%
and ensure your family's safety.

00:31:04.300 --> 00:31:07.350 line:0%
♫Now I have someone to cherish in my life♫

00:31:06.750 --> 00:31:07.620 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:31:08.000 --> 00:31:11.350 line:0%
♫I love you so much and you're my true love♫

00:31:11.730 --> 00:31:15.090 line:0%
♫With the moon in autumn and the breeze in spring, you're my only true love♫

00:31:15.760 --> 00:31:18.970 line:0%
♫Your palms and your eyes♫

00:31:19.830 --> 00:31:23.030 line:0%
♫Our love is getting stronger and stronger♫

00:31:23.570 --> 00:31:26.250 line:0%
♫You're my only true love♫

00:31:33.480 --> 00:31:34.480 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:31:39.520 --> 00:31:40.390 line:0%
What is it?

00:31:40.410 --> 00:31:41.320 line:0%
Should we send Madam back to Shen's Mansion

00:31:41.320 --> 00:31:43.320 line:0%
or to the Imperial Security Bureau?

00:31:44.730 --> 00:31:45.790 line:0%
To Shen's Mansion.

00:31:45.800 --> 00:31:46.600 line:0%
Understood.

00:31:51.320 --> 00:31:52.180 line:0%
What did you...

00:31:54.160 --> 00:31:55.420 line:0%
want to ask me just now?

00:31:56.900 --> 00:31:57.510 line:0%
No--

00:31:58.000 --> 00:31:59.170 line:0%
Nothing.

00:32:12.480 --> 00:32:13.280 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:32:14.220 --> 00:32:15.360 line:0%
you protect me,

00:32:15.560 --> 00:32:16.360 line:0%
help me,

00:32:16.710 --> 00:32:17.690 line:0%
and support me.

00:32:19.000 --> 00:32:20.370 line:0%
So in your heart,

00:32:21.470 --> 00:32:22.240 line:0%
what am I

00:32:22.240 --> 00:32:23.760 line:0%
to you exactly?

00:33:28.800 --> 00:33:29.820 line:0%
You...

00:33:31.610 --> 00:33:33.040 line:0%
You should go to bed early.

00:33:33.040 --> 00:33:34.300 line:0%
I'll study for a while.

00:33:35.550 --> 00:33:36.540 line:0%
Study?

00:33:40.790 --> 00:33:42.900 line:0%
The assessment for female officials is approaching.

00:33:42.900 --> 00:33:44.120 line:0%
I made a promise to Her Majesty

00:33:44.120 --> 00:33:45.120 line:0%
and Madam Xu

00:33:45.120 --> 00:33:46.200 line:0%
to take the exam

00:33:46.200 --> 00:33:48.400 line:0%
as a Document Secretary.

00:33:48.400 --> 00:33:49.360 line:0%
If I fail,

00:33:49.360 --> 00:33:50.400 line:0%
I won't even be able

00:33:50.400 --> 00:33:51.480 line:0%
to work as a scribe.

00:33:54.230 --> 00:33:56.760 line:0%
Now that Sister Caiwei's poison has been cured

00:33:56.760 --> 00:33:58.900 line:0%
and Chen Huo'e's case has been resolved,

00:33:58.900 --> 00:34:00.400 line:0%
it's time for me to study hard,

00:34:00.400 --> 00:34:01.480 line:0%
isn't it?

00:34:02.060 --> 00:34:02.920 line:0%
So tonight,

00:34:02.920 --> 00:34:03.760 line:0%
you've been going in and out,

00:34:03.760 --> 00:34:05.010 line:0%
moving so many things,

00:34:05.010 --> 00:34:06.760 line:0%
just to study by my light?

00:34:07.400 --> 00:34:08.200 line:0%
Yeah.

00:34:08.320 --> 00:34:09.800 line:0%
Don't you like brightness?

00:34:09.800 --> 00:34:11.200 line:0%
It saves several lamps.

00:34:18.760 --> 00:34:19.689 line:0%
Well then,

00:34:20.510 --> 00:34:21.840 line:0%
I wish you success in the exam

00:34:21.840 --> 00:34:23.499 line:0%
and may your wishes come true.

00:34:24.680 --> 00:34:26.340 line:0%
Thank you for your kind words.

00:34:50.470 --> 00:34:52.200 line:0%
It's rare for you to ask me out like this.

00:34:52.200 --> 00:34:53.459 line:0%
Is there any good news?

00:34:56.280 --> 00:34:57.080 line:0%
Well...

00:34:58.330 --> 00:34:59.480 line:0%
Thank you.

00:34:59.710 --> 00:35:02.310 line:0%
The poison of Yan family's lady has been cured.

00:35:03.050 --> 00:35:05.920 line:0%
Your prescription is real.

00:35:06.320 --> 00:35:07.120 line:0%
Of course.

00:35:07.530 --> 00:35:10.060 line:0%
How could the prescription I gave you be fake?

00:35:12.640 --> 00:35:13.440 line:0%
When...

00:35:14.560 --> 00:35:16.030 line:0%
have I ever deceived you?

00:35:16.140 --> 00:35:17.030 line:0%
You clearly...

00:35:22.740 --> 00:35:23.740 line:0%
Fine.

00:35:24.100 --> 00:35:25.450 line:0%
It was me who

00:35:25.470 --> 00:35:27.930 line:0%
kept calling you Ghost Face.

00:35:28.460 --> 00:35:30.640 line:0%
You didn't really deceive me.

00:35:31.750 --> 00:35:32.820 line:0%
Anyway...

00:35:33.810 --> 00:35:34.830 line:0%
Anyway,

00:35:35.250 --> 00:35:36.050 line:0%
thank you.

00:35:37.090 --> 00:35:37.980 line:0%
Thank you.

00:35:40.250 --> 00:35:41.500 line:0%
That's all?

00:35:43.960 --> 00:35:45.220 line:0%
It might not be enough.

00:35:45.710 --> 00:35:47.580 line:0%
Then what do you want?

00:35:48.540 --> 00:35:50.210 line:0%
You shouldn't be asking me.

00:35:51.360 --> 00:35:53.250 line:0%
You should think about

00:35:53.840 --> 00:35:56.390 line:0%
how you're going to thank me.

00:36:13.560 --> 00:36:14.490 line:0%
Lu Chuichui.

00:36:15.230 --> 00:36:16.160 line:0%
Lu Chuichui.

00:36:17.760 --> 00:36:18.870 line:0%
I'm here.

00:36:19.980 --> 00:36:21.060 line:0%
Chuichui!

00:36:24.730 --> 00:36:25.660 line:0%
Chuichui!

00:36:25.800 --> 00:36:26.680 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:36:26.920 --> 00:36:28.180 line:0%
What's wrong with you?

00:36:32.120 --> 00:36:32.920 line:0%
Nerd Jiang.

00:36:34.600 --> 00:36:35.400 line:0%
I...

00:36:37.280 --> 00:36:38.080 line:0%
He...

00:36:40.130 --> 00:36:41.320 line:0%
I thought...

00:36:43.440 --> 00:36:44.280 line:0%
I thought...

00:36:45.480 --> 00:36:46.530 line:0%
What happened?

00:36:55.130 --> 00:36:55.970 line:0%
Nothing.

00:36:56.290 --> 00:36:57.650 line:0%
My feet fell asleep.

00:37:00.600 --> 00:37:01.740 line:0%
Your feet fell asleep?

00:37:01.740 --> 00:37:02.680 line:0%
You scared me to death.

00:37:02.680 --> 00:37:03.040 line:0%
I thought

00:37:03.040 --> 00:37:04.780 line:0%
something terrible had happened to you.

00:37:04.780 --> 00:37:06.280 line:0%
Nerd Jiang.

00:37:08.250 --> 00:37:09.890 line:0%
Can you take me home?

00:37:13.250 --> 00:37:14.480 line:0%
Come on, slowly.

00:37:17.430 --> 00:37:18.490 line:0%
What are you doing?

00:37:19.250 --> 00:37:21.160 line:0%
Didn't you say your feet fell asleep?

00:37:21.160 --> 00:37:22.560 line:0%
I'll carry you on my back.

00:37:30.560 --> 00:37:31.360 line:0%
Nerd Jiang.

00:37:32.040 --> 00:37:32.990 line:0%
Listen,

00:37:33.280 --> 00:37:34.700 line:0%
if there's a person

00:37:34.840 --> 00:37:36.560 line:0%
who is usually vicious and cruel,

00:37:36.560 --> 00:37:37.810 line:0%
hated by everyone,

00:37:38.280 --> 00:37:40.240 line:0%
but occasionally shows kindness

00:37:40.240 --> 00:37:41.970 line:0%
and genuinely helps others,

00:37:42.760 --> 00:37:44.120 line:0%
is he a good person?

00:37:44.500 --> 00:37:46.350 line:0%
Is he worth being friends with?

00:37:47.050 --> 00:37:49.700 line:0%
Friends are chosen by oneself.

00:37:49.900 --> 00:37:50.970 line:0%
Ask your heart,

00:37:51.040 --> 00:37:52.040 line:0%
not other people.

00:37:52.720 --> 00:37:53.700 line:0%
If you

00:37:53.920 --> 00:37:55.650 line:0%
believe that person is a friend

00:37:55.880 --> 00:37:58.230 line:0%
and a good person,

00:37:58.610 --> 00:37:59.960 line:0%
and he won't hurt you,

00:38:00.010 --> 00:38:01.740 line:0%
then he's definitely worth it.

00:38:01.890 --> 00:38:03.170 line:0%
Ask your heart,

00:38:03.600 --> 00:38:04.600 line:0%
not other people.

00:38:39.800 --> 00:38:41.550 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:39:17.110 --> 00:39:18.080 line:0%
Chi.

00:39:17.740 --> 00:39:19.440 line:0%
[To Chi]

00:39:18.760 --> 00:39:20.760 line:0%
By the time you receive this letter,

00:39:20.760 --> 00:39:21.960 line:0%
I will probably be participating in

00:39:21.960 --> 00:39:23.920 line:0%
the female official assessment for the Six Ministries.

00:39:23.920 --> 00:39:24.770 line:0%
I'm going

00:39:24.880 --> 00:39:26.640 line:0%
all-in on this,

00:39:26.720 --> 00:39:29.000 line:0%
risking my career as a female official in the Ministry of Justice.

00:39:29.000 --> 00:39:29.800 line:0%
But I think

00:39:29.960 --> 00:39:31.640 line:0%
I won't let down the trust of

00:39:31.640 --> 00:39:33.280 line:0%
Her Majesty and Madam Xu,

00:39:33.720 --> 00:39:34.880 line:0%
nor the help

00:39:34.160 --> 00:39:37.350 line:0%
[Spring and Autumn Annals]

00:39:35.180 --> 00:39:36.460 line:0%
he's given me.

00:39:43.970 --> 00:39:45.840 line:0%
[Jun]

00:39:56.240 --> 00:40:02.430 line:0%
[First Rank, No. 1, Yan Xing]

00:40:02.430 --> 00:40:05.940 line:0%
[The List]

00:40:07.120 --> 00:40:08.680 line:0%
Oh my, Xing,

00:40:08.680 --> 00:40:10.270 line:0%
you're the No. 1!

00:40:10.300 --> 00:40:12.290 line:0%
Xing is the top of the first rank!

00:40:12.640 --> 00:40:14.630 line:0%
That's great, Xing!

00:40:14.660 --> 00:40:17.320 line:0%
You've finally been promoted to the Secretary!

00:40:18.720 --> 00:40:19.840 line:0%
I'm about to have

00:40:19.840 --> 00:40:22.170 line:0%
an eighth-rank sister looking out for me!

00:40:22.560 --> 00:40:23.610 line:0%
What about you?

00:40:23.760 --> 00:40:24.560 line:0%
Me?

00:40:24.630 --> 00:40:26.260 line:0%
I don't care anymore.

00:40:26.400 --> 00:40:27.240 line:0%
Anyway, I already have

00:40:27.240 --> 00:40:28.280 line:0%
an eighth-rank sister now.

00:40:28.280 --> 00:40:29.810 line:0%
It doesn't matter if I fail.

00:40:30.280 --> 00:40:31.570 line:0%
-I'm happy.
-Chuichui!

00:40:31.570 --> 00:40:32.630 line:0%
Chuichui!

00:40:34.680 --> 00:40:35.520 line:0%
You made the list!

00:40:35.520 --> 00:40:37.230 line:0%
You finally made it!

00:40:37.440 --> 00:40:38.160 line:0%
Now

00:40:38.160 --> 00:40:39.560 line:0%
you don't need me to spend money

00:40:39.560 --> 00:40:40.520 line:0%
on tutors.

00:40:40.520 --> 00:40:42.840 line:0%
You made it entirely on your own merit.

00:40:42.960 --> 00:40:43.960 line:0%
Even though you're in last place,

00:40:43.960 --> 00:40:46.540 line:0%
I'm still proud of you.

00:40:46.070 --> 00:40:49.050 line:0%
[Second Rank, No. 30, Lu Chuichui]

00:40:47.270 --> 00:40:49.450 line:0%
My sweetheart!

00:40:49.480 --> 00:40:50.480 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:40:50.800 --> 00:40:52.850 line:0%
Madam has been promoted to Secretary of the Ministry of Justice.

00:40:52.850 --> 00:40:54.650 line:0%
Her rank is now higher than mine.

00:40:54.720 --> 00:40:55.580 line:0%
Not convinced?

00:40:56.840 --> 00:40:57.640 line:0%
Not at all.

00:40:57.840 --> 00:40:59.040 line:0%
I'm truly convinced.

00:41:02.360 --> 00:41:03.160 line:0%
Let's go.

00:41:12.080 --> 00:41:12.880 line:0%
Father,

00:41:13.040 --> 00:41:15.930 line:0%
the transfer order doesn't mention the Yan family at all.

00:41:15.930 --> 00:41:17.390 line:0%
Did you read it carefully?

00:41:19.680 --> 00:41:21.280 line:0%
I've carefully searched through every line.

00:41:20.750 --> 00:41:21.390 line:0%
[The List]

00:41:21.280 --> 00:41:21.880 line:0%
There isn't any.

00:41:21.880 --> 00:41:23.400 line:0%
Minister Zhang's personally signed transfer order.

00:41:23.400 --> 00:41:25.200 line:0%
Among the officials sent to guard the border in the desert,

00:41:25.200 --> 00:41:26.800 line:0%
there's no one from the Yan family.

00:41:26.800 --> 00:41:27.640 line:0%
That's great!

00:41:27.660 --> 00:41:30.180 line:0%
Thank heavens!

00:41:31.880 --> 00:41:34.040 line:0%
Our Yan family has finally escaped this disaster.

00:41:34.040 --> 00:41:35.930 line:0%
Finally.

00:41:37.880 --> 00:41:38.890 line:0%
Xing,

00:41:39.300 --> 00:41:40.280 line:0%
today our Yan family

00:41:40.280 --> 00:41:41.790 line:0%
has received double happiness.

00:41:41.790 --> 00:41:43.650 line:0%
Double happiness indeed!

00:41:48.080 --> 00:41:49.680 line:0%
Let's have something nice for dinner?

00:41:49.680 --> 00:41:50.320 line:0%
Good.

00:41:50.920 --> 00:41:52.640 line:0%
Good.

00:41:54.040 --> 00:41:54.720 line:0%
Mother.